                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cfeb1db9-271e-3a45-b310-25f703c32dd1",
                        "entry_id": "218f55ff-b2da-37c2-a5cf-5a6efeb570f7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "зоол. млекопитающее, единственный представитель отряда трубкозубых (лат. Orycteropus afer)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b4a35fe-eb79-45bd-815d-3cecf49e5ae9",
                                "sense_id": "cfeb1db9-271e-3a45-b310-25f703c32dd1",
                                "text": "Тут можно наблюдать всяких лори, трубкозубов, древолазных дикобразов, ящуров, ехидн."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7ba1b728-6bfa-4147-9bf3-7f55fe1a31c8",
                        "source_entry_id": "218f55ff-b2da-37c2-a5cf-5a6efeb570f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "cfeb1db9-271e-3a45-b310-25f703c32dd1",
                        "target_lang_word": "aardvark",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aardvark",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "780cecaf-2aff-3e2a-8082-530a9df4f4c9",
                                        "entry_id": "6869f497-8109-3ef4-a75d-d25ed8460bcb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The nocturnal, insectivorous, burrowing, mammal Orycteropus afer, of the order Tubulidentata, somewhat resembling a pig, common in some parts of sub-Saharan Africa."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab6eda96-f380-4b89-b27a-b38a70a0f108",
                                                "sense_id": "780cecaf-2aff-3e2a-8082-530a9df4f4c9",
                                                "text": "The aardvark burrows in the ground and feeds mostly on termites, which it catches with its long, slimy tongue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e94adc84-0792-4142-a104-2c121a9649dd",
                                                "sense_id": "780cecaf-2aff-3e2a-8082-530a9df4f4c9",
                                                "text": "If ‘aardvark lover’ has that syntactic structure, then it determinately means “lover of aardvarks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "53673235-98c6-40aa-a8a1-2f617d48dabe",
                        "source_entry_id": "218f55ff-b2da-37c2-a5cf-5a6efeb570f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "cfeb1db9-271e-3a45-b310-25f703c32dd1",
                        "target_lang_word": "cerdo hormiguero",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cerdo hormiguero",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9e13e1f-cd40-3bf0-9732-1a9134c69634",
                                        "entry_id": "ea91906b-3ce3-3cfc-ac90-e76fc4ea9f38",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(Orycteropus afer) Mamífero placentario nativo de África. Es de color pardo en la parte superior, y rojiza en la inferior. Llega a medir hasta 2,2 m de largo. Tiene un hocico parecido al del cerdo y garras fuertes; pasa el día dentro de madrigueras subterráneas. Son animales temerosos y solitarios. Las extremidades anteriores tienen 4 dedos y las posteriores 5 dedos."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "519ee5c4-3081-4ea5-885d-476dbece5d9b",
                        "source_entry_id": "218f55ff-b2da-37c2-a5cf-5a6efeb570f7",
